# Cases reproducing the cooked-mesh loader bugs recorded in
# src/assets/issues.md. Found under generator version 1.
#
#  * A truncated .cooked whose header still declared the full index count fed
#    an under-allocated GPU buffer -> out-of-bounds reads at draw time.
#  * indexStride of 0/1/3 was silently reinterpreted as 16-bit, scrambling
#    primitive geometry instead of failing.
#
# These exercise the Truncate / InflateIndexCount / BadIndexStride /
# BadVertexStride / HugeCounts corruption branches plus the round-trip
# property (valid output must always load back).
